%% description: Ideating a feature: the agent draws, Archer presents, the person comments, the agent revises.
sequenceDiagram
    actor developer as Developer
    participant coding_agent as Coding Agent
    participant archer as Archer
    participant web_page as Archer Page
    developer->>coding_agent: Describe the new feature
    coding_agent->>archer: validate_diagram on a new note
    archer-->>coding_agent: Problems at their lines, or none
    coding_agent->>archer: present_diagram
    archer->>web_page: Show the diagram
    archer-->>coding_agent: Page URL
    coding_agent-->>developer: The URL and one sentence
    loop until the picture looks right
        developer->>web_page: Select parts, write comments
        developer->>web_page: Send to agent
        web_page->>archer: Sent comments
        archer-)coding_agent: archer wait ends with them
        coding_agent->>archer: get_comments
        archer-->>coding_agent: Threads with their anchors
        coding_agent->>archer: write_diagram with expectedRevision
        archer->>web_page: Redraw and name the change
        coding_agent->>archer: reply_comment, resolve_comment
        archer->>web_page: The agent's answer
    end
    Note over developer,coding_agent: Agreed on the picture before any code
